DEFAULT IS A ROW AT ALL: with the old single bit, mutating that default `0` -> `1` moved ZERO of the rows (`V2`, reported as vacuous), because the claim was folded away.** THE `kern` DRIVER COMPARES A COUNT WHERE THE THINGS ARE NAMES, and `kern_blind_holds` measures why that is the CEILING -- `device_vocab_holds` MEASURES THE PREMISE EVERY RUN (CPython has no `str -> int` device index: `hasattr(Device,'tag')` is False, `ParamArg.device` is a `str`, `Device.__getitem__` is string-keyed) and the port's own `tag_of` is a three-valued sentinel -- while a TWO-DEVICE node makes the count 2 on both lanes. The gate no longer justifies that wall by naming a symbol in `uop/spec.bend`'s comment; it measures the wall, and `uop/spec.bend`'s three `Device.tag` citations were rewritten to the mechanism those measurements describe. THE `arg` PAYLOAD IS IN EVERY TOKEN NOW: TWO FIXTURE NODES THAT PRINT ALIKE ARE TWO NODES A READER CAN CONFUSE, AND MEASURED OVER THE 65 NODES THIS CENSUS SPELLED 32 DISTINCT TOKENS FOR 65 NODES -- 147 of the 2080 pairs indistinguishable -- against 60 and 8 after, every one of the eight a pair whose TWO ARGS ARE EQUAL. `argkinds_hold` REQUIRES THAT NO LANE PRINTED THE `[?]` AN UNSPELLED `Arg` KIND WOULD PRINT. THE DRIVER AXIS IS READ BACK FROM FOUR PLACES BY `axis_hold`: the oracle's `DRIVERS` BY PATH, the oracle's `drive` ladder, and the bend lane's own `rs_drv_name` and `rs_d.go`.
